{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>לא איש וגו׳.</b> He has already sworn to them to bring them in and to give them possession of the land of seven nations — and you think to kill them in the wilderness?" "<b>ההוא אמר וגו׳.</b> In a tone of astonishment. Its Targum: וְתָיְבִין וּמִתְמַלְכִין — they reconsider and reconsider to retract them."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:12:26.681464237Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}